# Allowlist, not blocklist.
#
# The first version of this file excluded paths by pattern and was wrong in two ways that a
# dry run caught: "reviewer*.md" does not match "19reviewer-comments.md" (the pattern is
# anchored at the start), and the third-party PDFs live under a differently named directory
# than the one that was excluded. A blocklist has to enumerate every sensitive path and fails
# silently when it misses one; it also fails open, so a mistake publishes material.
#
# So: ignore everything, then un-ignore the artifact. A new file is excluded until someone
# deliberately adds it here, which fails closed.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/MAINTAINER-NOTES.md
!/tools/

# The only project directory that belongs in the artifact.
!/Rec-AD/
/Rec-AD/*
!/Rec-AD/code/

# Inside the code tree, only source and its two configuration files.
/Rec-AD/code/*
!/Rec-AD/code/**/
!/Rec-AD/code/**/*.py
!/Rec-AD/code/requirements.txt
!/Rec-AD/code/config.yaml

# Large generated inputs are rebuilt by the documented command; the IEEE 300-bus case alone
# is 763 MB, above GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
/Rec-AD/code/data_cache/
**/*.npz

# Results: the 118 per-run records that back the paper's tables and figures are published,
# enumerated one by one. The exclusion above existed because the committed numbers were
# debug-tier and sat beside a paper reporting named-device resources; the paper now names the
# device and these are the numbers it reports, so the reason has lapsed.
#
# The list is explicit rather than a pattern that re-permits the directory. A pattern would
# fail open: the partial runs, the superseded batches, the synthetic self-test files and the
# internal audit records that share this directory would be published without a decision.
/Rec-AD/code/results/*
# The wildcard above excludes the contents, not the directory. Excluding the directory itself
# would stop git descending into it and every negation below would be dead, which is the
# documented behaviour: a file cannot be re-included if a parent directory is excluded.
!/Rec-AD/code/results/PUBLISHED-README.md
!/Rec-AD/code/results/PUBLISHED-MANIFEST.sha256
!/Rec-AD/code/results/M2-MATRIX.json
