# Virtual environments: several GB of CUDA runtime.
**/.venv*/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# Local backups written during editing.
**/*.bak*
**/*_backup_*/

# Internal meeting material: carries tier=local numbers and a record of unimplemented
# components. Held back for the same reason results are, and for one more.
/Rec-AD/组会_internal/

# Figures produced by the old plotting script, which read every JSON in code/results/
# including the synthetic self-test files. Their numbers may come from that synthetic data
# and the figure itself does not show it, so they must not be published next to the paper.
# See Rec-AD/code/figures/DO-NOT-USE.md.
!/Rec-AD/code/figures/DO-NOT-USE.md
/Rec-AD/code/figures/fig1[1-7]_*

# One-off helpers written while working. Not part of the artifact: each did a single job
# (packing a deposit, running an ad-hoc check) and would only add noise to the source tree.
/Rec-AD/code/_scratch/
